{"id": "3fa911af-e5c3-415c-834b-7a9d46d4b556", "slug": "nexus-studio", "title": "Nexus Studio", "description": "Nexus Studio Sidebar Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus Studio\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Studio Sidebar Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF3B30\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#EF4444\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus Studio\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 10; favorites: 6; remixes: 0.\nTags: sidebar, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, navigation, links, social-proof.\n## Overview\nNexus Studio Sidebar Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nBook a 30-Min Call / with Alex (n)exus.studio® 2 open slots for June 2026 /Home /About /Case Studies /012/ /Blog /Contact (555) 019-8372 hello@nexus.studio © 2026 nexus studio. All rights reserved. (n) ® Local time: Jun…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Think /Big.; We'll /Scale..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF3B30, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #EF4444, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth dark\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus Studio</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP & Three.js for Animations/WebGL -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        /* Subtle diagonal background pattern (Dark Mode) */\n        .bg-grid-pattern {\n            background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n                -45deg,\n                transparent,\n                transparent 10px,\n                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 10px,\n                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 11px\n            );\n        }\n\n        /* Diagonal corner clip-path for buttons */\n        .clip-diagonal {\n            clip-path: polygon(10px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 10px);\n        }\n\n        /* Premium Border Gradient Treatment */\n        .border-gradient-shell {\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .border-gradient-shell::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            padding: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%);\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            clip-path: polygon(10px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 10px);\n        }\n\n        /* Barcode lines */\n        .barcode-line { display: inline-block; height: 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-right: 2px; }\n\n        /* Typography overrides */\n        h1, h2, h3, .display-text {\n            letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n        }\n\n        .masked-container {\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: inline-block;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"antialiased text-white bg-gray-950 h-screen w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row overflow-hidden selection:bg-red-500 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- ==================== SIDEBAR ==================== -->\n    <aside class=\"w-full md:w-[320px] h-auto md:h-full flex-shrink-0 border-r border-white/10 flex flex-col relative z-20 bg-gray-950/80 backdrop-blur-xl\">\n\n        <!-- Top Booking Bar -->\n        <div class=\"bg-black text-white w-full px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer group hover:bg-white/5 border-b border-white/5 transition-colors\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"w-8 h-8 overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-gray-800\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=100&h=100\" alt=\"Alex Profile\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-90 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">\n                    Book a 30-Min Call <span class=\"text-white/40 font-normal\">/ with Alex</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-white/50 group-hover:text-white group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col px-10 py-10 relative\">\n\n            <!-- Vertical Brand Mark -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-4 top-40 transform -rotate-90 origin-left text-xs tracking-widest font-medium text-white/30 uppercase\">\n                (n)exus.studio®\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Status -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-16 pl-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-8\">\n                <div class=\"flex gap-1\">\n                    <div class=\"w-px h-5 bg-red-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(239,68,68,0.5)]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-px h-5 bg-red-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(239,68,68,0.5)]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-px h-5 bg-white/20\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-px h-5 bg-white/20\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white/90\">\n                    2 open slots for <span class=\"text-white/40\">June 2026</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Navigation -->\n            <nav class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 pl-4\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors tracking-tight\">/Home</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors tracking-tight\">/About</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors tracking-tight relative group inline-flex w-fit\">\n                    /Case Studies\n                    <span class=\"absolute -top-2 -right-10 text-xs text-red-500 font-medium tracking-normal\">/012/</span>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors tracking-tight\">/Blog</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors tracking-tight\">/Contact</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Content -->\n            <div class=\"mt-auto pl-4 pt-12\">\n                <!-- Decorative Barcode -->\n                <div class=\"mb-8 flex items-end opacity-40 mix-blend-screen\">\n                    <div class=\"barcode-line w-1\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"barcode-line w-0.5\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"barcode-line w-1.5\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"barcode-line w-0.5\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"barcode-line w-2\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"barcode-line w-0.5\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"barcode-line w-1\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"barcode-line w-1.5\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"barcode-line w-0.5\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"barcode-line w-1\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"barcode-line w-0.5\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Contact Info -->\n                <div class=\"mb-4\">\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-white/40 mb-1\">(555) 019-8372</p>\n                    <a href=\"mailto:hello@nexus.studio\" class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white hover:text-red-500 transition-colors block\">\n                        hello@nexus.studio\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Footer -->\n                <div class=\"mt-16 flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-white/30\">\n                        © 2026 nexus studio.<br>\n                        All rights reserved.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-4 text-white/40\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-circle-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon></a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:camera-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon></a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:global-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon></a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <!-- ==================== MAIN CONTENT ==================== -->\n    <main class=\"flex-1 h-full relative bg-gray-950 overflow-y-auto overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n        <!-- Image First Stage Layer -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-[url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?q=80&w=2560&auto=format&fit=crop')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-10 mix-blend-screen grayscale\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-gray-950 via-gray-950/80 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Background Grid WebGL Canvas -->\n        <canvas id=\"webgl-grid\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-40\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- Subtle Diagonal Pattern Overlay -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 bg-grid-pattern opacity-50 mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Framed Grid Lines (Skill Directive) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-8 pointer-events-none z-0 border border-white/5\">\n            <!-- Corner L-Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-6 h-6 border-t-[1.5px] border-l-[1.5px] border-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-6 h-6 border-t-[1.5px] border-r-[1.5px] border-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-6 h-6 border-b-[1.5px] border-l-[1.5px] border-white/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-6 h-6 border-b-[1.5px] border-r-[1.5px] border-white/20\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Internal Guide Lines & Mini Corner Squares -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-1/3 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-white/5\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-1/3 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-white/5\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-white/5\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Intersection Nodes -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-1/3 top-1/2 w-1 h-1 bg-white/20 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-1/3 top-1/2 w-1 h-1 bg-white/20 transform translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-1/3 top-0 w-1 h-1 bg-white/20 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-1/3 top-0 w-1 h-1 bg-white/20 transform translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-1/3 bottom-0 w-1 h-1 bg-white/20 transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-1/3 bottom-0 w-1 h-1 bg-white/20 transform translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 h-full flex flex-col p-12 md:p-16 lg:p-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full\">\n\n            <!-- Header Row -->\n            <header class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-16 w-full\">\n                <div class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tighter text-white/30\">\n                    (n)<sup class=\"text-sm\">®</sup>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs text-white/40 flex items-center gap-1 font-medium tracking-wide uppercase\">\n                    Local time: <span class=\"text-white/90 font-medium\" id=\"current-time\">June 14, 09:42 AM</span>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n\n            <!-- Hero Text Block -->\n            <div class=\"max-w-xl mb-16 pt-8\">\n                <p class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal leading-tight text-white/80 tracking-tight\">\n                    We build digital experiences & interfaces that actually scale operations for modern teams.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Massive Animated Typography (Masked Reveal Skill) -->\n            <div class=\"mt-auto mb-16 flex flex-col gap-2 w-full\">\n                <div class=\"masked-container w-full\">\n                    <h1 class=\"hero-word text-[12vw] md:text-[8rem] lg:text-[11rem] leading-[0.85] font-semibold text-white display-text drop-shadow-2xl\">\n                        Think /Big.\n                    </h1>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"masked-container w-full\">\n                    <h1 class=\"hero-word text-[12vw] md:text-[8rem] lg:text-[11rem] leading-[0.85] font-semibold text-white display-text drop-shadow-2xl\">\n                        We'll /Scale.\n                    </h1>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- CTA Section -->\n            <div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-8 w-full border-t border-white/10 pt-8 bg-gray-950/20 backdrop-blur-sm -mx-12 px-12 pb-12 -mb-12 md:m-0 md:p-0 md:bg-transparent md:backdrop-blur-none\">\n\n                <div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n                    <!-- Primary Button with Corner Diagonals Skill -->\n                    <button class=\"clip-diagonal bg-[#FF3B30] hover:bg-[#E0352B] text-white px-8 py-5 flex items-center gap-3 transition-colors text-sm font-medium tracking-wide shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,59,48,0.2)]\">\n                        Start a Project\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n\n                    <!-- Secondary Button with Corner Diagonals & Gradient Border Skill -->\n                    <button class=\"clip-diagonal border-gradient-shell bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md text-white px-8 py-5 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                        See our work\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Trust / Proof Block -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 ml-0 md:ml-8\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex text-[#FF3B30] text-sm\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/80\">4.9 / 5</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-white/40 font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-xs mt-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-white/90\">We've helped 120+ teams</span> streamline their workflows—yours could be next.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Interactions Script -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            // Register GSAP plugins\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Masked Reveal Animation for massive text\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power4.out\" } });\n\n            tl.fromTo(\".hero-word\",\n                { y: \"110%\", rotation: 2, opacity: 0 },\n                { y: \"0%\", rotation: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1.2, stagger: 0.15, delay: 0.2 }\n            );\n\n            // Simple time updater\n            const timeElement = document.getElementById('current-time');\n            const updateTime = () => {\n                const now = new Date();\n                const options = { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' };\n                timeElement.innerText = now.toLocaleDateString('en-US', options);\n            };\n            updateTime();\n            setInterval(updateTime, 60000); // Update every minute\n\n            // WebGL Background Grid Initialization\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-grid');\n            if (canvas && typeof THREE !== 'undefined') {\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n                // Add soft fog for depth fade\n                scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x030712, 0.06);\n\n                const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, canvas.clientWidth / canvas.clientHeight, 0.1, 100);\n                camera.position.set(0, 1.5, 6);\n                camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n                renderer.setSize(canvas.clientWidth, canvas.clientHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n                // Horizon perspective grid\n                const gridHelper = new THREE.GridHelper(50, 50, 0xffffff, 0xffffff);\n                gridHelper.material.opacity = 0.08;\n                gridHelper.material.transparent = true;\n                scene.add(gridHelper);\n\n                // Additive particle field\n                const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n                const particlesCount = 400;\n                const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n                for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i++) {\n                    posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 30; // x\n                    posArray[i+1] = Math.random() * 5;        // y\n                    posArray[i+2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 30; // z\n                }\n                particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n                const particlesMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                    size: 0.03,\n                    color: 0xffffff,\n                    transparent: true,\n                    opacity: 0.4,\n                    blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n                });\n                const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, particlesMaterial);\n                scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n                // Animation loop\n                let time = 0;\n                function animate() {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                    time += 0.0015;\n\n                    // Slow forward drift for the grid\n                    gridHelper.position.z = (time * 15) % 1;\n\n                    // Gentle particle float\n                    particlesMesh.rotation.y = time * 0.05;\n                    particlesMesh.position.y = Math.sin(time * 2) * 0.1;\n\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                }\n                animate();\n\n                // Handle resize\n                window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                    camera.aspect = canvas.clientWidth / canvas.clientHeight;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer.setSize(canvas.clientWidth, canvas.clientHeight);\n                });\n\n                // Parallax Mouse Effect\n                document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                    const x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth) - 0.5;\n                    const y = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight) - 0.5;\n                    gsap.to(camera.position, {\n                        x: x * 0.5,\n                        y: 1.5 + (y * -0.5),\n                        duration: 1.5,\n                        ease: \"power2.out\"\n                    });\n                    camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-studio-3.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-studio.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-studio-3-DESIGN.md", "views": 85, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T06:41:56.509008+00:00"}